From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Santiago Palladino <santiago@aztec-labs.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:37:34 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(world-state): expose the canonical genesis measurement

`measureCanonicalGenesis` returns the seeded nullifiers, the genesis
nullifier-tree root, the block-header hash and the archive root from one
ephemeral world state, so the foundation's regeneration script and the
`compute-genesis-values` CLI read the same numbers rather than each
deriving their own.

The l2_block genesis test now reads GENESIS_NULLIFIER_TREE_ROOT from the
generated constants instead of repeating the literal, so a regeneration
no longer has to reach into the patch series to update it.

